        "si_used": false,
        "procedure": "H2L (17.2 mg, 0.04 mmol), CH3ONa (8.6 mg, 0.16 mmol) and Gd(acac)3·2H2O (58.9 mg, 0.12 mmol) were mixed in 8 mL of MeOH. Treatment with NaClO4 (9.8 mg, 0.08 mmol) in 4 mL of methanol afforded a red solution, which was magnetically stirred for 10 min and then filtered. Black-red block-shaped crystals were collected by filtration after slow evaporation of the resulting solution for several days.",
